---
title: Pan Yogurt Flatbread
servings: 2
prep time: 15 minutes
cook time: 8 minutes
description: simple, light bread
tags:
  - breakfast
  - vegetarian
  - quick
  - pan
  - light
---

Combine the @flour{150%g}, @plain yogurt{110%g},
@baking powder{1%tsp}, @salt{0.5%tsp} and
@olive oil{1%tsp} into a dough.

Knead for 2–3 minutes until smooth.

Leave to rest for ~{5-10%minutes}.

Divide into two balls and roll into flat rounds.

Heat a #dry frying pan{} over medium-low heat.

Cook each flatbread for approximately 2 minutes per side,
until golden spots appear.
